  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Secretariat of the Pacific Regional Environment Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment will support the Secretariat of the Pacific Regional Environment Programme (SPREP) deliver against its Strategic Plan 2017-26. Our commitment to financially support SPREP is consistent with our 10-year partnership (2021-31).

This investment will provide both core and non-core funding. Our support will empower SPREP to deliver better environmental and climate change outcomes for its Members, and bolster Pacific leadership and coordination on these issues.</narrative>
  </description>
